  _ = `Pitch, yaw and roll speeds should each be very close to zero when the controller is on a stationary surface. Some noise is expected. If any are biased in one direction, controls will 'Drift' in game. Click 'Calibrate' to correct the 'Drift'`,
  _ = `When "Auto-Calibration" is turned on, Gyro Drift is re-calibrated opportunistically. Excessive motion will reset the process any time it exceeds the tolerances above. Tune these tolerances so that "Auto-Calibration Progress" never fills completely while you are holding the controller - only while on a stationary surface.`,
