  _ = `Move the mouse with: `,
  _ = `Click mouse with: `,
  _ = `Magnifier Tool`,
  _ = `This game has small text that may be hard to read on Deck.`,
  _ = `This game has small text that may be hard to read on your screen.`,
  _ = `Hold to magnify: `,
  _ = `Pan magnifier view: `,
  _ = `External Controller Translation`,
  _ = `Right now, Steam Input is translating your external controller for %1$s. This means you may not see controller glyphs that match your controller.`,
  _ = `If you know %1$s has native support for your specific controller, you can turn off Steam Input in the Controller Settings for the game.`,
  _ = `Steam Input Games`,
  _ = `This game has native support for <1>Steam Input</1>, the system Steam uses to translate your physical inputs. With native support, your layout will show Game Actions instead of generic commands.`,
  _ = `These games will often contain <1>Action Sets</1> - different control schemes that are used during different parts of the game.`,
  _ = `This means you'll be able to fully customize every part of the game to suit your preferences, but only if you choose to. The default layout provided by the game's developer will just work.`,
