  _ = `Deflects a virtual joystick, using your trackpad position directly to control how far it is deflected.`,
  _ = `Deflects a virtual joystick, using your gyro position directly to control how far it is deflected.`,
  _ = `Moves the mouse cursor at a steady speed for as long as you hold a deflection, and faster the further you push.`,
  _ = `Moves the mouse cursor the way you move on the pad, the way a laptop trackpad does.`,
  _ = `The older joystick mouse mode, kept for configurations that already use it.`,
  _ = `Turns the controller's motion into mouse movement, so you aim by tilting it.`,
  _ = `Sends camera stick input, where how far you push sets how fast the camera turns.`,
  _ = `Turns the controller's motion into camera stick input, for games that read a stick rather than a mouse.`,
  _ = `Turns the controller's motion into stick deflection, as though you were pushing a stick that far.`,
  _ = `Maps the pad onto a region of the screen, so a spot on the pad always points at the same place.`,
  _ = `Sends the game a camera angle directly, for games that support it, rather than the mouse or stick movement the other modes produce.`,
  _ = `Leaves the control doing nothing while this is the choice.`,
  _ = `Sends joystick input to the game, but reads your trackpad motion like a mouse. For games that expect a stick to aim or to move a cursor.`,
  _ = `Sends joystick input to the game, but reads your gyro motion like a mouse. For games that expect a stick to aim or to move a cursor.`,
  _ = `Flick the stick in a direction to snap the camera that way, then keep rotating the stick to turn the camera by the same amount.`,
