  _ = `Style of Input - Hotbar Menu`,
  _ = `For games where there are more commands than you can fit on your controller, a hotbar allows you do use the DPad or Joystick to map commands to a virtual menu. Pressing Down on the DPad / Joystick will toggle the menu, Left/Right will scroll through the options, and Up will activate the selected item.`,
