  _ = `Mode Shifting`,
  _ = `Mode Shifting allows an input style on the controller to be 'shifted' into another mode while a button is being held.  When released, the mode will change back to its normal mode.  This allows additional buttons to be mapped or settings to be changed between modes.  You can define what mode this input shifts into, as well as what button shifts it, here.`,
