  _ = `Directional Pad Layout`,
  _ = `This option selects the type of DPad emulation.`,
  _ = `Radial Without Overlap`,
  _ = `A four way pie shaped layout with diagonals that only activate the single nearest directional command.`,
  _ = `Radial With Overlap`,
  _ = `A pie shaped layout with diagonals that activate both directional commands.`,
  _ = `Analog Emulation`,
  _ = `The directional commands are sent to the game in pulses to simulate an analog stick.`,
  _ = `Cross Gate`,
  _ = `A cross-shaped pad layout that prioritizes horizontal and vertical movement over the diagonals.`,
  _ = `Click`,
  _ = `This command will be performed when you click the pad/stick. If the 'Requires Click' option is also set, clicking a pad direction will send the corresponding direction command as well as this command to the game.`,
  _ = `Touch`,
  _ = `This command will be performed when you touch the pad/stick.`,
  _ = `Overlap Region`,
  _ = `Overlap Region defines how much space in the diagonals applies to both directions.  At its lowest setting, overlap is nearly removed, acting almost like a 4-way control, at its highest, overlap is almost always applied unless precisely on a cardinal direction.`,
  _ = `Haptic Intensity Override`,
