  _ = `Outer Ring Command Radius`,
  _ = `When outside this radius on the D-Pad, the assigned button or key will be sent.  For example, the 'Run' or 'Sprint' button could be assigned when holding at the edge.  The slider can be visualized as extending a radius from the center outward, with the point being where the outer ring begins.`,
  _ = `Outer Ring Command`,
  _ = `When outside the specified radius on the D-Pad, the assigned button or key will be sent.  For example, the 'Run' or 'Sprint' button could be assigned when holding at the edge.`,
  _ = `Outer Ring Command Invert`,
  _ = `If set, the command will be sent when inside the radius instead of outside.  For example, 'Walk' or 'Sneak' could be sent when inside a certain zone.`,
  _ = `Outer Ring Invert - On`,
  _ = `The assigned button will be sent if inside the specified Outer Ring Command Radius. For example, 'Walk' or 'Sneak' could be sent when inside a certain zone.`,
  _ = `Outer Ring Invert - Off`,
  _ = `The assigned button will be sent if outside the specified Outer Ring Command Radius. For example, 'Run' or 'Sprint' could be sent when outside a certain zone.`,
  _ = `Button Behavior`,
  _ = `The gyro input button behavior can be flipped.  If set to off, gyro will turn off when the button is pressed.`,
  _ = `Gyro Button Behavior - On`,
  _ = `If set, the device's gyro will turn on when the button is pressed.`,
  _ = `Gyro Button Behavior - Off`,
  _ = `If set, the device's gyro will turn off when the button is pressed.`,
  _ = `Gyro Button Behavior - Toggle`,
  _ = `If set, the device's gyro will toggle its state each time the button is pressed.`,
  _ = `Turn the controller around its own vertical axis for horizontal output. Tilt the controller up and down around its own lateral axis for vertical output. (Local Space Preset)`,
  _ = `Lean the controller around its forward axis for horizontal output. Tilt the controller up and down around its own lateral axis for vertical output. (Local Space Preset)`,
  _ = `Yaw + Roll adds the Lean and Turn together for horizontal output. Tilting the controller up and down around its own lateral axis still moves the mouse up and down. (Local Space Preset)`,
  _ = `Local Space is similar to Yaw + Roll, but gives full control over the pitch angle of the principle axis. You can also adjust the contribution of the complementary axis (which is at 90 degrees to the principle axis).`,
  _ = `Player Space uses Yaw + Roll around the gravity axis for horizontal output, and Local Pitch for vertical output.`,
  _ = `World Space uses all rotation around the gravity axis for horizontal output, and World Pitch for vertical output, but does not move vertically when the controller is tilted on its side`,
  _ = `Acts similar to a laser pointer. Great for cursor control or Light Gun games on a stand-alone controller.`,
