  _ = `If set, the device's gyro will turn off when the button is pressed.`,
  _ = `Gyro Button Behavior - Toggle`,
  _ = `If set, the device's gyro will toggle between being enabled or disabled when the button is pressed.`,
  _ = `Gyro Pitch Neutral Angle`,
  _ = `This is the default position for a Centered joystick.  By changing this setting you can alter the neutral centered position to tilt forward or backward which is comfortable to your playing position.  Note that for uses like a steering wheel, it is recommended to disable the vertical portion entirely and just use the Horizontal Axis, where this angle will not come into play.`,
  _ = `Click`,
  _ = `This command will be performed when you click the stick.`,
  _ = `Swipe Duration`,
  _ = `Swipes will cause a joystick 'flick' motion, as if slamming the stick to the side for a moment.  How long should this 'joystick pegged' command persist?`,
  _ = `Swipe Duration - Off`,
  _ = `Swipes will not have any extended 'joystick pegged' interaction.`,
  _ = `Swipe Duration - Low`,
  _ = `Swipes will cause a joystick 'flick' motion, as if slamming the stick to the side for a moment.  With a low duration it will quickly reset.`,
  _ = `Swipe Duration - Medium`,
  _ = `Swipes will cause a joystick 'flick' motion, as if slamming the stick to the side for a moment.  With a medium duration it will persist slightly before resetting.`,
  _ = `Swipe Duration - High`,
  _ = `Swipes will cause a joystick 'flick' motion, as if slamming the stick to the side for a moment.  With a high duration it will persist for a long duration before resetting.`,
  _ = `Stick Response Curve`,
