  _ = `Gyro Pitch Neutral Angle`,
  _ = `This is the default position for a Centered joystick.  By changing this setting you can alter the neutral centered position to tilt forward or backward which is comfortable to your playing position.  Note that for uses like a steering wheel, it is recommended to disable the vertical portion entirely and just use the Horizontal Axis, where this angle will not come into play.`,
  _ = `Gyro Lock at Edges`,
  _ = `When set, if the pad is rotated past outer edge, it will lock to that edge.  If not set, it may flip to the opposite side when crossing this outer edge.  If you experience problems with the controller locking up over time, you may want to disable this option.`,
  _ = `Gyro Lock at Edges`,
  _ = `When set, if the pad is rotated past outer deadzone, it will lock to that edge until rotated past 180 degrees.  If not set, it may begin to rotate in the opposite direction as it approaches 180 degrees of rotation.  If you experience problems with the controller locking up over time, disable this option.`,
  _ = `Gyro Lock at Edges`,
  _ = `When set, if the pad is rotated past outer deadzone, it will lock to that edge until rotated past 180 degrees.  If not set, it may begin to rotate in the opposite direction as it approaches 180 degrees of rotation.  If you experience problems with the controller locking up over time, disable this option.`,
