  _ = `Double Tap Command`,
  _ = `A button can be sent when double tapping on the pad.  Tapping doesn't not require a full click, just a quick double-tap on the pad.`,
  _ = `Double Tap Duration`,
  _ = `Double Tap Duration sets the time required between times to register as a double tap.  Lower values will require a very fast double tap while higher values will allow a long time between taps.`,
